whoWeAreTitle:"Sisi ni Nani",whoWeAreText:"Dereva Kiganjani ni jukwaa kamili la kidijitali lililobuniwa kubadilisha huduma za madereva Tanzania. Tunatoa uzoefu wenye ufanisi kwa kujifunza madereva, majaribio, leseni, na mahali pa kazi, kuhakikisha usalama, utaalamu, na ufanisi kila hatua.",backedByMDVTitle:"Imedhaminiwa na MDV Vehicle Fleet",backedByMDVText:"Dereva Kiganjani ni programu yenye fahari ya MDV Vehicle Fleet Limited, kampuni inayoongoza usafiri na usimamizi wa magari Tanzania.",visitMDVWebsite:"Tembelea Tovuti ya MDV",whatWeOfferTitle:"Tunafanya Nini",elimikaAboutDesc:"Elimu kamili ya udereva na kozi za multimedia na ufuatiliaji wa maendeleo.",jiTestiAboutDesc:"Majaribio ya kitaalamu ya udereva na matokeo ya papo hapo na vyeti vya kidijitali.",leseniAboutDesc:"Maombi ya leseni yaliyoboreshwa na upya wa leseni na ufuatiliaji wa nyaraka.",recruitmentLabel:"Uajiri",recruitmentAboutDesc:"Unganisha madereva na waajiri kupitia wasifu uliothhibitishwa na kuoana kwa ajira.",impactStatsTitle:"Athari Yetu",driversTrainedLabel:"Madereva Waliofunzwa",testsCompletedLabel:"Majaribio Yaliyokamilika",licensesProcessedLabel:"Leseni Zilizosindikwa",placementsMadeLabel:"Mahali pa Kazi",exploreServicesTitle:"Tayari Kuanza?",exploreServicesText:"Gundua huduma zetu kamili na ujiunge na maelfu ya madereva wanaoamini Dereva Kiganjani.",exploreServices:"Gundua Huduma",servicesTitle:"Huduma Zetu",servicesSubtitle:"Huduma kamili za madereva zilizoundwa kusaidia safari yako kutoka kujifunza hadi ajira.",leseniServiceDesc:"Omba au upya leseni yako ya udereva na mchakato wetu ulioboreshwa wa kidijitali.",leseniFeature1:"Maombi na upya ya mtandaoni",leseniFeature2:"Upakiaji na uthibitishaji wa nyaraka",leseniFeature3:"Ufuatiliaji wa hali ya wakati halisi",jiTestiServiceDesc:"Fanya majaribio ya kitaalamu ya madereva kwa makundi A hadi E na maswali ya multimedia.",jiTestiFeature1:"Maswali ya chaguo-nyingi yenye picha na video",jiTestiFeature2:"Uchunguzi wa papo hapo na matokeo",jiTestiFeature3:"Cheti cha kidijitali baada ya kufaulu",elimikaServiceDesc:"Pata kozi kamili za elimu ya udereva na vifaa mbalimbali vya kujifunza.",elimikaFeature1:"Masomo ya maandishi, PDF, na video",elimikaFeature2:"Majaribio ya maingiliano na tathmini",elimikaFeature3:"Ufuatiliaji wa maendeleo na vyeti",ajiraServiceDesc:"Unda wasifu wako wa udereva na omba ajira na waajiri waliothhibitishwa.",ajiraFeature1:"Jenga wasifu wa kitaalamu wa udereva",ajiraFeature2:"Vinjari na omba fursa za ajira",ajiraFeature3:"Fuatilia hali ya maombi",ajiriServiceDesc:"Chapisha nafasi za kazi na uajiri madereva waliothhibitishwa, wenye sifa kwa biashara yako.",ajiriFeature1:"Chapisha orodha za ajira na mahitaji",ajiriFeature2:"Kagua wasifu wa madereva na maombi",ajiriFeature3:"Oana na wagombea wenye sifa",howItWorksTitle:"Inafanyaje Kazi",step1Title:"Unda Akaunti Yako",step1Desc:"Jisajili kwa barua pepe yako au nambari ya simu ili uanze na Dereva Kiganjani.",step2Title:"Chagua Huduma Yako",step2Desc:"Chagua kutoka kwa huduma zetu: majaribio, kujifunza, leseni, au fursa za ajira.",step3Title:"Maliza Malipo",step3Desc:"Lipia huduma zinazohusika kwa usalama kupitia mfumo wetu uliopatanishwa wa malipo.",step4Title:"Maliza Mchakato",step4Desc:"Fanya majaribio, maliza kozi, wasilisha maombi, au omba ajira.",step5Title:"Pata Matokeo na Arifa",step5Desc:"Pokea matokeo ya papo hapo, vyeti, na arifa kuhusu maendeleo yako.",faqTitle:"Maswali Yanayoulizwa Mara Kwa Mara",faq1Question:"Ninajisajili vipi kwenye Dereva Kiganjani?",faq1Answer:'Bonyeza kitufe cha "Anza Sasa" au "Ingia" na unda akaunti kwa kutumia barua pepe yako au nambari ya simu. Utahitaji kukamilisha usanidi wa wasifu wako kabla ya kupata huduma.',faq2Question:"Mnakubali njia gani za malipo?",faq2Answer:"Tunakubali pesa za simu (M-Pesa, Tigo Pesa, Airtel Money) na uhamisho wa benki kwa huduma zetu zote.",faq3Question:"Inachukua muda gani kusindika ombi la leseni?",faq3Answer:"Usindikaji wa leseni kawaida unachukua siku 5-10 za biashara baada ya uthibitishaji wa nyaraka. Unaweza kufuatilia hali ya maombi yako wakati halisi kupitia dashibodi yako.",faq4Question:"Naweza kufanya tena mtihani kama nitashindwa?",faq4Answer:"Ndiyo, unaweza kurudia mtihani baada ya masaa 24. Kila jaribio la mtihani linahitaji malipo tofauti.",faq5Question:"Je, kozi zina vyeti?",faq5Answer:"Ndiyo, kozi zetu zote za kujifunza zina vyeti na zinatambuliwa na mamlaka husika. Unapokea cheti cha kidijitali baada ya kukamilisha kwa mafanikio.",readyToStartTitle:"Tayari Kuanza?",readyToStartText:"Jiunge na maelfu ya madereva wanaoamini Dereva Kiganjani kwa maendeleo yao ya kitaalamu.",contactTitle:"Wasiliana Nasi",contactSubtitle:"Wasiliana na timu yetu. Tuko hapa kukusaidia na maswali au wasiwasi wowote.",officeAddressLabel:"Anwani ya Ofisi",visitByAppointment:"Tembelea kwa miadi tu",phoneLabel:"Simu",workingHoursLabel:"Jumatatu - Ijumaa, 8AM - 5PM",emailLabel:"Barua Pepe",supportEmailLabel:"Msaada na maswali",officeHoursLabel:"Masaa ya Ofisi",mondayFriday:"Jumatatu - Ijumaa",sendMessageTitle:"Tutumie Ujumbe",sendMessageDesc:"Jaza fomu hapa chini na tutawasiliana nawe haraka iwezekanavyo.",namePlaceholder:"Weka jina lako kamili",emailPlaceholder:"barua.pepe@mfano.com",subjectLabel:"Mada",selectSubject:"Chagua mada",generalInquiry:"Swali la Jumla",technicalSupport:"Msaada wa Kiufundi",businessPartnership:"Ushirikiano wa Biashara",messageLabel:"Ujumbe",messagePlaceholder:"Tuambie jinsi tunavyoweza kukusaidia...",sendMessage:"Tuma Ujumbe",errorTitle:"Hitilafu",fillRequiredFields:"Tafadhali jaza sehemu zote zinazohitajika.",messageSentTitle:"Ujumbe Umetumwa!",messageSentDesc:"Asante kwa kuwasiliana nasi. Tutawasiliana nawe hivi karibuni.",whatsappTitle:"Ongea kwenye WhatsApp",whatsappDesc:"Pata msaada wa papo hapo kupitia chatbot yetu ya WhatsApp.",whatsappAvailable:"Inapatikana 24/7 kwa maswali ya haraka na msaada.",chatOnWhatsApp:"Ongea kwenye WhatsApp",quickLinksLabel:"Viungo vya Haraka",helpCenterLabel:"Kituo cha Msaada",userGuideLa